ER","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723399060","pull_request_review_id":3700372300,"id":2723399060,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6iU8WU","diff_hunk":"@@ -340,7 +340,7 @@ void SkyRD::ReflectionData::update_reflection_data(int p_size, int p_mipmaps, bo\n \ttf.format = p_texture_format;\n \ttf.width = p_low_quality ? 160 : p_size >> 1; // Always 160x160 when using REALTIME.\n \ttf.height = p_low_quality ? 160 : p_size >> 1;\n-\ttf.mipmaps = p_low_quality ? 5 : mipmaps - 1;\n+\ttf.mipmaps = p_low_quality ? 5 : MAX(mipmaps - 1, 1);","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/sky.cpp","commit_id":"e7094dd8fe7afbc8db39e35e04ca5db8cc369e86","original_commit_id":"e7094dd8fe7afbc8db39e35e04ca5db8cc369e86","user":{"login":"xhocquet","id":8116516,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTY1MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8116516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet","html_url":"https://github.com/xhocquet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Is it typical to limit project settings for individual bugs like this? I'd be worried about a) existing code to fix these kinds of edge cases becoming obsolete and b) limiting functionality that does work. So I asked for some extra info to reproduce the other issues he saw above with `roughness=1` since I thought it would be better to fix a couple of edge cases instead of limiting a project setting.\r\n\r\nThere is some prior code around [clamping mipmaps based on roughness layers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/light_storage.cpp#L1525) or [clamping other values based on `mipmap - 1`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/renderer_scene_render_rd.cpp#L593). Is that a pattern to continue or is this case different?","created_at":"2026-01-24T01:33:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T01:33:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#discussion_r2723399060","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723399060"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#discussion_r2723399060"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723399060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":343,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2722623072,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723408281","pull_request_review_id":3700382834,"id":2723408281,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6iU-mZ","diff_hunk":"@@ -340,7 +340,7 @@ void SkyRD::ReflectionData::update_reflection_data(int p_size, int p_mipmaps, bo\n \ttf.format = p_texture_format;\n \ttf.width = p_low_quality ? 160 : p_size >> 1; // Always 160x160 when using REALTIME.\n \ttf.height = p_low_quality ? 160 : p_size >> 1;\n-\ttf.mipmaps = p_low_qualit