,"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I don't think you are understanding the scope of the bug, which can be very dangerous when attempting a fix. Making random changes that seem to work can avoid the symptoms of the bug, but rarely are they the proper fix. \r\n\r\nHere the bug is in higher level behaviour, so the solution needs to be in higher level behaviour too. \r\n\r\nAdding safety checks in low level code is like putting a bandaid on a deep cut","created_at":"2026-01-24T03:43:07Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T03:43:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#discussion_r2723554530","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723554530"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#discussion_r2723554530"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723554530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":343,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2722623072,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]